{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115375","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115375/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115375/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115375/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115375","id":3853869395,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7ltWFT","number":115375,"title":"GDScript tool script can cause editor crash on null object","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-01-25T21:15:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-22T23:34:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.rc2 / 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Fedora 42\n\n### Issue description\n\nGiven this poorly written `@tool` script\n```\n@tool\nextends Control\n\n@onready var vbox : VBoxContainer = $VBoxContainer\n\nvar border_element_array : Array\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n\tprint(\"Hello World\")\n\tvar instance = TextureRect.new()\n\tborder_element_array.append(instance)\n\tinstance.tex = preload(\"res://icon.svg\")\n\tvbox.add_child(instance)\n\tinstance.owner = self\n\t\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:    \n\tprint(\"Bye World\")\n\tfor item in border_element_array:\n\t\titem.queue_free()\n```\nThis will lead to `OPCODE_CALL_ASYNC`, `OPCODE_CALL_RETURN`, and `OPCODE_CALL` handlers crashing because `base_obj` is null, but the handler does not explicitly check for this before calling methods on the base object.\n\nIdeally, the VM should guard against this issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a simple UI scene with Control as the root and a VBoxContainer container child\n3. Create a second scene that contains anything.\n4. Leave both scenes open\n5. Go back to the first scene, attach the tool script.\n6. You may need to reload the editor or the current scene for the tool script to take effect\n7. Click on the second scene tab\n8. Editor crashes\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115375/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115375/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}